"zh":"啊，你好。找我有事吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"If you are weary, traveller, come in and sit. Many come to light candles of late; the chapel is brighter than it used to be.","zh":"旅人，若是累了，便进来坐坐。近来点烛的人多，堂里倒比往日亮些。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Those who come to pray these days ask for longer days and quiet nights. I tell them what the Church teaches: suffering brings us closer to God.","zh":"近来来祷告的人，求的多是白昼长些、夜里平安。我便照教会的教导告诉他们：苦难使人接近神。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The well has gone too salty to drink. We walk the better part of an hour for water now.","zh":"井水咸得没法喝了，现在挑一趟水得走大半个时辰。"}}]}}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk0.s0.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk0.s0.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk0.s0.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/vessel/flask/holy_water","id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk0.s1.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk0.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk0.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk0.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1","type":"actor/person/traveler","name":{"en":"Ivo Sheafbrook","zh":"伊沃·捆溪"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"tithe.milletfield-shrine","x":19,"y":10},"facing":"down","props":{"age":44,"household":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.h0","purse":6,"favourite":"item/material/gold_ingot"},"contents":["tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1.coin0","tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1.coin1","tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1.coin2","tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1.coin3","tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1.coin4","tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1.coin5"],"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.short","face":"face.stern","outfit":"outfit.tunic","legs":"legs.wraps"},"colors":{"skin":"warm","hair":"ash","eyes":"leaf","outfit.1":"slate","legs.1":"umber"}},"npc":{"role":"traveler","schedule":[{"from":21,"to":5,"map":"tithe.milletfield-shrine","x":11,"y":10,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":5,"to":12,"map":"tithe.milletfield-shrine","x":19,"y":10,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"tithe.milletfield-shrine","x":11,"y":10,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"tithe.milletfield-shrine","x":19,"y":10,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":21,"map":"tithe.milletfield-shrine","x":13,"y":6,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello. I haven't seen you before. Are you from out of town?","zh":"你好。没见过你，是外地来的吧？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The Church named me for the pilgrimage. They say it is calling people everywhere; of every ten I meet on the road, three or four are on the same errand.","zh":"教会点了我的名，叫我去朝圣。听说各地都在召人，路上碰见的十个人里，倒有三四个跟我一样。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Six days on the road to get here, and I've worn through my soles. Is there a cobbler round here?","zh":"我走了六天才到这儿，鞋底都磨穿了。这附近有补鞋的吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Every sack of grain is weighed first, and the granary takes its share before we get ours. This year, after that, we have half a sack left.","zh":"麦子收上来先过秤，交够粮仓的份才轮到自家。今年交完，家里就剩小半袋。"}}]}}},{"id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1.coin4","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1.coin5","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk2","type":"actor/person/traveler","name":{"en":"Bettris Sheafbrook","zh":"贝特丽丝·捆溪"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"tithe.milletfield-shrine","x":15,"y":13},"facing":"down","props":{"age":41,"household":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.h0","purse":3,"favourite":"item/food/fish/catfish"},"contents":["tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk2.coin0","tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk2.coin1","tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk2.coin2"],"look":{"body":"woman","parts":{"hair":"hair.long","face":"face.weary","outfit":"outfit.cloak","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"fair","hair":"black","eyes":"hazel","outfit.1":"charcoal","shoes.1":"umber"}},"npc":{"role":"traveler","schedule":[{"from":21,"to":7,"map":"tithe.milletfield-shrine","x":15,"y":13,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":7,"to":12,"map":"tithe.milletfield-shrine","x":21,"y":21,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"tithe.milletfield-shrine","x":15,"y":13,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"tithe.milletfield-shrine","x":21,"y":21,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":21,"map":"tithe.milletfield-shrine","x":15,"y":13,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello. I haven't seen you before. Are you from out of town?","zh":"你好。没见过你，是外地来的吧？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Six days on the road to get here, and I've worn through my soles. Is there a cobbler round here?","zh":"我走了六天才到这儿，鞋底都磨穿了。这附近有补鞋的吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Every sack of grain is weighed first, and the granary takes its share before we get ours. This year, after that, we have half a sack left.","zh":"麦子收上来先过秤，交够粮仓的份才轮到自家。今年交完，家里就剩小半袋。"}}]}}},{"id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk2.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk2"}},{"id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk2.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk2"}},{"id":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk2.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.milletfield-shrine.folk2"}}]}